{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>And because He loved.</b> And all this is because He loved." "<b>And He brought you out before His face.</b> Like a man who leads his son before him, as it is said: ״וַיִּסַּע מַלְאַךְ הָאֱלֹהִים הַהֹלֵךְ וגו׳ וַיֵּלֶךְ מֵאַחֲרֵיהֶם״ (ibid.). Another interpretation: <b>And He brought you out before His face</b> — before their fathers, as it is said: ״נֶגֶד אֲבוֹתָם עָשָׂה פֶלֶא״ (Psalms 78); and do not wonder that He referred to them in the singular, since He wrote them in the singular — <b>and chose His seed after him</b>."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:02.032112950Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}